From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] v4l2_codec2: report the picture size when it changes

The framework puts C2StreamPictureSizeInfo::output into the output
format, and for clients that use the output buffer array (synchronous
NDK clients, or clients calling getOutputBuffers()) it sizes the
buffers it copies the frames into from that format. DecodeComponent
never updated the picture size after a source change, so after a
resolution increase the copies keep the starting size, the framework
fails to copy the frames ("tried 5 realloc and failed") and the codec
reports an error. The software decoders set the new size on their
interface and put it into the work's configUpdate.

Do the same with the first frame of a new visible size.

Checked on SC8280XP (Huawei MateBook E Go) with an H.264 stream that
goes from 720p to 1080p, decoded by a synchronous byte-buffer client:
before, the hardware decoder failed after 299 frames; with the patch all
598 frames decode, identical to the software decoder. Surface and
byte-buffer decoding of 8-bit and 10-bit streams is unchanged.

Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 components/DecodeComponent.cpp                |  9 +++++++++
 components/DecodeInterface.cpp                | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../v4l2_codec2/components/DecodeInterface.h  |  5 +++++
 3 files changed, 33 insertions(+)

diff --git a/components/DecodeComponent.cpp b/components/DecodeComponent.cpp
index a409d11..70c8ccd 100644
--- a/components/DecodeComponent.cpp
+++ b/components/DecodeComponent.cpp
@@ -613,6 +613,15 @@ void DecodeComponent::onOutputFrameReady(std::unique_ptr<VideoFrame> frame) {
     C2Work* work = it->second.get();
 
     C2ConstGraphicBlock constBlock = std::move(frame)->getGraphicBlock();
+    // Report a new visible size with the first frame that has it, as the software decoders do.
+    // The framework puts the picture size into the output format's width and height and sizes
+    // the client's copies from them when the client uses the output buffer array (synchronous
+    // NDK clients, getOutputBuffers()). Without this update those clients fail on the first
+    // larger frame with "tried 5 realloc and failed".
+    if (std::unique_ptr<C2Param> sizeUpdate = mIntfImpl->updatePictureSize(
+                constBlock.crop().width, constBlock.crop().height)) {
+        work->worklets.front()->output.configUpdate.push_back(std::move(sizeUpdate));
+    }
     std::shared_ptr<C2Buffer> buffer = C2Buffer::CreateGraphicBuffer(std::move(constBlock));
     if (mPendingColorAspectsChange &&
         work->input.ordinal.frameIndex.peeku() >= mPendingColorAspectsChangeFrameIndex) {
diff --git a/components/DecodeInterface.cpp b/components/DecodeInterface.cpp
index 0397deb..19128f9 100644
--- a/components/DecodeInterface.cpp
+++ b/components/DecodeInterface.cpp
@@ -498,6 +498,25 @@ c2_status_t DecodeInterface::queryHdrStaticInfo(
     return C2_OK;
 }
 
+std::unique_ptr<C2Param> DecodeInterface::updatePictureSize(uint32_t width, uint32_t height) {
+    if (width == 0 || height == 0) return nullptr;
+
+    C2StreamPictureSizeInfo::output size(0u, width, height);
+    C2StreamPictureSizeInfo::output current(0u, 0u, 0u);
+    if (query({&current}, {}, C2_DONT_BLOCK, nullptr) == C2_OK && current == size) {
+        return nullptr;
+    }
+
+    std::vector<std::unique_ptr<C2SettingResult>> failures;
+    const c2_status_t status = config({&size}, C2_MAY_BLOCK, &failures);
+    if (status != C2_OK) {
+        ALOGW("Failed to set the output picture size to %ux%u: %d", width, height, status);
+        return nullptr;
+    }
+    ALOGV("Output picture size changed to %ux%u", size.width, size.height);
+    return C2Param::Copy(size);
+}
+
 c2_status_t DecodeInterface::queryColorAspects(
         std::shared_ptr<C2StreamColorAspectsInfo::output>* targetColorAspects) {
     std::unique_ptr<C2StreamColorAspectsInfo::output> colorAspects =
diff --git a/components/include/v4l2_codec2/components/DecodeInterface.h b/components/include/v4l2_codec2/components/DecodeInterface.h
index d5c006b..70de126 100644
--- a/components/include/v4l2_codec2/components/DecodeInterface.h
+++ b/components/include/v4l2_codec2/components/DecodeInterface.h
@@ -37,6 +37,11 @@ public:
             std::shared_ptr<C2StreamColorAspectsInfo::output>* targetColorAspects);
     // Returns C2_NOT_FOUND when the client gave no HDR static metadata.
     c2_status_t queryHdrStaticInfo(std::shared_ptr<C2StreamHdrStaticInfo::output>* targetInfo);
+    // Sets the output picture size to the visible size of a decoded frame. Returns the new value
+    // for the work's configUpdate, or nullptr when the size is unchanged or was not accepted.
+    // The interface keeps the value, so the framework reads the same size when it queries the
+    // component again, e.g. when it resumes after a flush.
+    std::unique_ptr<C2Param> updatePictureSize(uint32_t width, uint32_t height);
 
 private:
     // Configurable parameter setters.
